"P926081928" "Helix got the data, pull out!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3289787275" "Crow hands you a satchel filled with bundles of explosives."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P146613186" "That could have gone real bad, {HeroName}. Neuron was real crafty when he put in that Freezer. It restored the ICE that I'd disabled earlier and waited until I was working on a critical piece of the security code. If I hadn't detected it in time either the entire database would have locked down, or I would have gotten a 100,000 volt lobotomy.<br><br>But that's part of the job, no? We aren't playing a game here, this is for all the marbles. We either sink, or we swim and with this data, I think we can win this thing!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - WoundedManDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P4031272834" "<color orange>The half-starved man before you is dressed in grubby, torn, and blood stained clothes. He is badly beaten, but still alive.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1402254366" "I'm here to help."
// Page HelpPage1 Text :
"P658246450" "<color orange>The man manages to only let out a groan. His attempt to push himself up off the ground is feeble at best.</color><br><br>"They... they took Candace... and the others...""
// Answer Text :
"P1908997224" "Who did, Ghouls?"
// Page GhoulsPage1 Text :
"P1647814853" "Yes... we... we escaped."
// Answer Text :
"P1346637565" "Escaped?"
// Page EscapePage1 Text :
"P3861974614" "Yes... captured... enslaved. No idea... how long..."
// Answer Text :
"P3505013164" "Enslaved? They didn't eat you?"
// Page EnslavedPage1 Text :
"P921192344" "Some do... they're... they're building... a city down there..."
// Answer Text :
"P3983627568" "A city? Is there a leader?"
// Page LeaderPage1 Text :
"P2899005454" "<color orange>The man gives you a questioning look.</color><br><br>"How did you know?""
// Answer Text :
"P1976071624" "There are rumors, and it appears they are true."
// Page RumorsPage1 Text :
"P2349391227" "I... I'm not strong enough... to save Candace... or the others... will you help me?"
// Answer Text :
"P1891364394" "I will, but first, I need to get you out of here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2317372661" "It's going to take me some time to both analyze this data and set up the necessary equipment for the procedure required. What we need now is to locate acceptable test subjects and that means heading down into the tunnels and actually looking for Ghouls.<br><br>Scott doesn't want us to tip the PPD off that we're up to anything new, so he's not reorganizing our forces in the slightest. <color orange>That means it's up to you to find the test subjects.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2549212325" "Find test subjects"
// SendOffString :
"P408689557" "When I was cloaked in the tunnels I noticed that the Ghouls have a very animalistic societal structure. The biggest ones appear to be the leaders, but they lead only because of brute force, it's actually the ones we call <color red>Painted Ones</color> who retain the majority of their reasoning and problem solving abilities. But there's more to it than that, {HeroName}.<br><br>The Painted Ones... they seem to have their own heirarchy between themselves, and not only within their individual packs, but intra-pack relations as well.<br><br>I have a theory that the stories aren't all that far fetched. The stories that somewhere there is a leader of the Ghouls who is guiding them. If we could find him and convince him to join us, many lives could be saved.<br><br><color orange>I want you to look for any signs of this mysterious leader of the Ghouls while you're down there.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P368294889" "Search for Test Subjects"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3880558432" "Remember, your primary mission is to secure test subjects for us to use this cure on. A sweeper team will follow you to collect the fallen. But remember, look for any sign of a leader amongst the Ghouls."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P224563128" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Survival of the Fittest</color>"

