// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - RescueWoundedMan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2855269042" "You see indications that several people were dragged off by the Ghouls, kicking and struggling. They're still alive!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1580159542" "You saved a man from being beaten to death by Ghouls, then discovered that he was one of a handful of escaped slaves!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P275874471" "Slaves?<br><br><color orange>You imagine that there is a perplexed look on Helix's face under her helmet.</color><br><br>Well, this is proof that there is some sort of society at work amongst the Ghouls, but I'm not sure they will be people we can negotiate with. Keeping slaves is a savage practice. Though, I suppose slightly more civilized than simply eating them.<br><br>I'll need to question this man more about what he's seen and experienced. And {HeroName}, you did right by bringing him back. If you'd charged after his friends, we may have lost both of you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - GhoulDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1504035874" "<color orange>Behind the snarling visage of this cannibalistic creature you can see the faintest glimmer of reason. It asks you a question.</color><br><br>"What want?""
// Answer Text :
"P3513954774" "Tell him about peace."
// Page PeacePage1 Text :
"P1690314683" "<color orange>The creature makes a choking noise, you think it could be a laugh.</color><br><br>"No peace.""
// Answer Text :
"P2392806580" "Tell him about the cure."
// Page CurePage1 Text :
"P2956076654" "<color orange>The creature looks between its companions and they all grunt and growl.</color><br><br>"What want cure?""
// Answer Text :
"P246299191" "Explain to him the alliance and revenge."
// Page RevengePage1 Text :
"P2171126318" "<color orange>The painted one grunts and gurgles at you.</color><br><br>"We want.""
// Answer Text :
"P2496849525" "You tell him to send one to prove cure is real."
// Page ProofPage1 Text :
"P598394488" "<color orange>The Ghouls snarl and grunt.</color><br><br>"No, want now, all.""
// Answer Text :
"P2594248832" "Explain that testing on one is better."
// Page TestingPage1 Text :
"P1660488788" "<color orange>The Painted One leader seems to understand, and he steps forward to go with you.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1517400020" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3503273879" "I talked to our survivor, his name is Adam Meyers. As near as I can tell, he and his wife, Candace, disappeared seven months ago. From what he's told me, the Ghouls are being gathered enforce into a single massive pack, all ruled by a single leader. He only saw the creature once, and it displayed a more human mannerism to it, but still had to remind the others of his dominance through savage displays of strength.<br><br>We know where their leader lives, {HeroName}, and if he really does have some intelligence then <color orange>it would be in our best interest to at least try diplomacy first.</color> Scott is a big proponent of gunpoint diplomacy and he's pretty sure it's the only way we're going to convince this Ghoul king that it would be best to negotiate with us."
// AcceptString :
"P3517020672" "Try Diplomacy"
// SendOffString :
"P1072620407" "Adam insisted that he accompany you back down there. He's malnurished, but he could do it. Scott told me not to let him go. You'd think he'd understand but he had a point, this mission is too important to let personal feelings jeopardize it.<br><br>Remember, these are Ghouls you are dealing with. They don't know fear. Somehow you're going to have to convince them to stop fighting and realize that not every situation is a life or death decision.<br><br>Every Ghoul you kill is one less person we can save and turn against Neuron and Tyrant."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2079519511" "Try to Communicate with the Ghouls"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3612115817" "You need to get that thing taken care off we talked about earlier."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P539506549" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Gunpoint Diplomacy</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3851442024" "You back track to where you found Adam Meyers and then track the Ghouls and their captives to this sub-section."
// Script Variable ChatMessage :
"P976972684" "Incoming Ghoul Horde!"
// Script Variable ChatMessage :
"P1710543984" "The Ghouls... they're fleeing!"
// Script Variable FloaterMessage :
"P3290215409" "Ghouls are Fleeing!"

