// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2612919966" "Grrr!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2925953179" "Slaughter!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P854706340" "Hrargh!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2096611708" "Hunt! Prey!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4240581617" "Kill {Hero.gender=male him|her}!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3956398600" "Grargh!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3071390145" "Attack!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3346078662" "Graa!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4167834268" "Painted One Leader"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3050910257" "Stop!<em>No Kill!<em>Talk!"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P223361328" "Grar?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4025310023" "You successfully forced the Ghouls into negotiation, and one of them has returned with you to be given the cure."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P20260111" "Communication with the Ghouls and now a cure! {HeroName}, this is an historic moment, this is the moment where everything changed, where the evils of Tyrant's empire finally caught up to them.<br><br>The procedure should only take a few hours to have a noticeable effect. Hopefully our Ghoulish friend here will be able to accelerate negotiations with his old packmates.<br><br><color orange>Many hours pass when suddenly Dr. Helix arrives with good news.</color><br><br>The cure! It worked!<br><br>Carlos Gomez may not win any beauty contests for the remainder of his life, but his body still retains most of the benefits of the genetic resequencing that Neuron conducted on it. But most importantly, his mind is his once more... and all the terrible memories that come with it.<br><br>Gomez is recovering at the moment, but I reported the success to Scott and he's convinced that we can sway the Ghouls to our cause with Mr. Gomez as our liaison. He just wants to make absolutely sure that this cure doesn't retrograde.<br><br>I'll have to do a few more tests, but as far as I can tell, Mr. Gomez is in pretty much the best shape of his entire life."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - VahzilokDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro3 Text :
"P2654393589" "Thank you."
// Answer Text :
"P3126882535" "You're welcome."
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P661500166" "<color orange>The Ghoul King bows his head to you slightly, already you can see his strength returning to him and a sharper glimmer in his eyes.</color><br><br>"You have saved me, for that my life is yours. The others will have to make their own choices once they too are themselves.<br><br>Thank you.""
// Answer Text :
"P405491381" "Who are you?"
// Page WhoPage1 Text :
"P2393501073" "<color orange>The Ghoul King, becoming less of a Ghoul with each passing moment, hangs his head momentarily and then looks you in the eye.</color><br><br>"I am the father of these poor souls. I am the man, no, the doctor, who created the serum that now drives these people mad. I am <color yellow>Demetrios Vasilikos</color>, and my legacy is also my curse.""
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P3926036428" "<color orange>The Ghoul who stands before you is different than all the others. He seems intelligent and far stronger than he looks. This is definitely the leader that Adam Meyers and Carlos Gomez spoke of. He looks between you and Gomez and speaks.</color><br><br>"How is... this?"<br><br><color orange>He sweeps his hand toward Gomez.</color><br><br>"Found g... gene...ti-ti-tic... s-s-seque...? Found c-c-cure?""
// Answer Text :
"P3422724524" "Tell him about Gomez and the Cure."
// Page CurePage1 Text :
"P949609340" "<color orange>The Ghoul King's eyes widen and he looks rapidly between you and Gomez. His mouth hangs agape, in wonder.</color><br><br>"Truth? Can be true? So... So long. F-f-finaly.<br><br>Give, need...<br><br>Please.""
// Answer Text :
"P1752634490" "Give him the cure."
// Page CurePage2 Text :
"P16937938" "<color orange>The Ghoul King takes the hypospray and examines it briefly, then, as if recalling how it works, he presses it against his neck and with a soft hiss the device administers the genetic resequencing agent into his body.<br><br>He takes a step back and seems to relax a bit, closing his eyes as the agent courses through his body. Already he must be feeling some effect. He drops the hypospray on the ground and slumps, obviously weakened.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P657248914" "Are you okay?"
// Page CurePage3 Text :
"P1119820667" "<color orange>The Man Slayers smell weakness and attack.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1973218118" "(Defend the Ghoul King)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1103424404" "Mr. Gomez has been in debriefings with Scott all morning. They're trying to pull every scrap of data they can about the Ghouls and their leader. If things get violent, knowing that information will be life saving.<br><br>Scott has told me that due to your past performance he wants to send you down with Mr. Gomez to conduct the negotiations."
// AcceptString :
"P3439264606" "Negotiate with Ghouls"
// SendOffString :
"P1612229877" "You're going straight into Ghoul Central. Gomez assures me that he can lead you to the Ghoul leader, but you'll have to keep yourself alive down there. Get an audience with the leader of the Ghouls and give him a dose of the cure so that he can see for himself that our offer is legitimate.<br><br>We're sending a pair of sharp shooters to follow you and give you covering fire if you need to retreat."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4024020798" "Remember, if things get violent you've got some back up."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1340006238" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: Talk Softly But Carry A Big Stick</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1911931455" "Gomez takes you further down than you've ever been."
// Script Variable HERO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P402300912" "It's just up ahead, I won't be able to protect you down this far, you'll have to demonstrate your strength."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P362283621" "Defend the king!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3858212693" "No Name"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3793214176" "I'm dead!"

