// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1587285490" "<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor white>Taking a shot. Blam-o!<t=2 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor white>Winged him!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1118167532" "<t=3 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor white>Gomez is friendly! Switchin' to Mr. Ugly Bucket.<t=2 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor white>He's feelin' that!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
